    "title": "Maathacare",
    "description": "MaathaCare is a smart digital pregnancy support system designed to enhance Sri Lanka\u2019s public maternal healthcare services through technology. While the existing healthcare framework is strong, many processes remain manual and paper-based. This often results in missed clinic visits, irregular use of supplements and tracking high risk pregnancies.",
